# Polymorphic function that generates HasField constraint
# The function takes a dict parameter and accesses a field
# Type inference should generate: forall d a. HasField "name" d a => (d) -> a
[get_name: [fn [dict] [get "name" dict]]
 result: [get_name [name: "Alice"]]]
=== out
Dict({"get_name": Function(dict), "result": String("Alice")})
